  "steps": [
    "Prepare the base.",
    "In a jug, add coconut water + regular water + blue pea flower extract (soak dried flowers in hot water for 5-6 mins). Mix well.",
    "Add soaked sabja seeds, salt, chaat masala, honey and lemon juice. Stir well.",
    "Add chopped mint leaves and ice cubes. Serve chilled. Finish within 3-4 hrs if kept at room temperature or refrigerate and keep enjoying till eve."
  ],
